 "remarks": "Beautifully renovated townhouse-style condo in a convenient South Norwalk location! This move-in-ready 2-bedroom, 1.5-bath home has been freshly painted and updated with new flooring and a refreshed full bathroom. The main level offers a comfortable living room, dining area, kitchen and half bath, creating an easy and functional layout for everyday living and entertaining. Upstairs you'll find two well-sized bedrooms and an updated full bath. An attached two-car garage located beneath the unit provides excellent parking and additional convenience. Ideally situated near SoNo's restaurants, shopping and entertainment, the South Norwalk Metro-North station, and convenient access to I-95 and Route 7. Fresh, updated and ready for immediate occupancy-just move in and enjoy!",
